OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with assisting
OL,4,Aoffender in shot PC case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man will appear in court after being
OL,7,Fcharged with assisting an offender in
OL,8,Fconnection with a police officer being
OL,9,Fshot in the foot.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,12,Fwas injured after approaching two
OL,13,Fpeople on Angel Row at about 04:50 BST
OL,14,Fon 18 October.
OL,16,FIn a statement, the force said Jahmal
OL,17,FRuddock-Senior, 35, would appear at
OL,18,FNottingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,19,FMonday.
